# Prisma
# website: https://www.prisma.io/
# docs: https://www.prisma.io/docs
# description: Next-generation ORM for Node.js and TypeScript, ignoring local SQLite database files, generated client outputs, and engine binaries.

# Local SQLite databases and journals
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Generated Prisma Client (custom output paths)
prisma/generated/
src/generated/prisma/

# Prisma engine binaries
*libquery_engine*
*migration-engine*
*introspection-engine*
*prisma-fmt*